# Unit02
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit02核心词汇

authority/ɔːˈθɔːrəti/权威；当局/The local authority made the final decision.
aware/əˈwer/意识到的/She was aware of the risks involved.
awkward/ˈɔːkwərd/尴尬的/There was an awkward silence in the room.
bachelor/ˈbætʃələr/学士；单身汉/He earned a bachelor's degree in law.
balance/ˈbæləns/平衡/You need to balance work and personal life.
ban/bæn/禁止/The government imposed a ban on plastic bags.
barrier/ˈbæriər/障碍/Language can be a barrier to communication.
behalf/bɪˈhæf/代表/I'm writing on behalf of my company.
beneficial/ˌbenɪˈfɪʃl/有益的/Exercise is beneficial to health.
bias/ˈbaɪəs/偏见/The report shows a clear bias against the defendant.
bind/baɪnd/约束/The contract binds both parties to the agreement.
blast/blæst/爆炸/A blast was heard miles away.
blend/blend/混合/The tea is a blend of several flavors.
block/blɑːk/阻碍/The heavy snow blocked the road.
boom/buːm/繁荣/The tech industry experienced a boom in the 2000s.
boost/buːst/促进/The new policy will boost economic development.
bound/baʊnd/一定的；受约束的/He is bound to succeed with such effort.
breach/briːtʃ/违反；突破/The company was fined for breach of contract.
breed/briːd/品种；繁殖/This breed of dog is very intelligent.
brilliant/ˈbrɪliənt/杰出的/She came up with a brilliant idea.
broad/brɔːd/广泛的/The survey covers a broad range of topics.
brutal/ˈbruːtl/残忍的/The war was brutal and destructive.
budget/ˈbʌdʒɪt/预算/The government increased the education budget.
bulk/bʌlk/大量/The bulk of the work has been completed.
burden/ˈbɜːrdn/负担/Taxes are a heavy burden on small businesses.
bureau/ˈbjʊroʊ/局/He works at the Federal Bureau of Investigation.
burst/bɜːrst/突然爆发/The audience burst into applause.
cabinet/ˈkæbɪnɪt/内阁；柜子/The president met with his cabinet.
calculate/ˈkælkjuleɪt/计算/Scientists calculated the distance to the moon.
campaign/kæmˈpeɪn/运动/The advertising campaign was very successful.
candidate/ˈkændɪdət/候选人/There are three candidates for the position.
capable/ˈkeɪpəbl/有能力的/She is capable of handling any challenge.
capacity/kəˈpæsəti/容量；能力/The stadium has a seating capacity of 80,000.
capture/ˈkæptʃər/捕获/The photographer captured a beautiful moment.
cast/kæst/投；铸造/She cast a glance at the clock.
casual/ˈkæʒuəl/随意的/He wore casual clothes to the meeting.
category/ˈkætəɡɔːri/类别/These items fall into different categories.
cease/siːs/停止/The factory ceased operations last year.
challenge/ˈtʃælɪndʒ/挑战/Facing challenges helps us grow.
channel/ˈtʃænl/渠道；频道/We communicate through different channels.
chapter/ˈtʃæptər/章节/Please read the first chapter of the book.
character/ˈkærəktər/性格；角色/She has a strong character.
charge/tʃɑːrdʒ/收费；指控/The hotel charges 500 yuan per night.
charity/ˈtʃærəti/慈善/She donated money to a local charity.
chronic/ˈkrɑːnɪk/慢性的/He suffers from chronic back pain.
circumstance/ˈsɜːrkəmstæns/情况/Under no circumstances should you give up.
cite/saɪt/引用/She cited several studies in her paper.
civil/ˈsɪvl/公民的/Civil rights are protected by the constitution.
claim/kleɪm/声称；索赔/He claimed that he was innocent.
clarify/ˈklærɪfaɪ/澄清/Can you clarify your position on this issue?
